@startuml
'[brief] Event carrying a typed parameter. Mirrors figure g4: the parameter value is stashed inside the FSM and reused by guards/actions.

'[header] using SPEED = int;

'[code] private:
'[code] SPEED reference_speed = 0;

[*] -> Idle
Idle -> Running : setSpeed(speed) [ speed > 0 ] / reference_speed = speed
Running -> Idle : halt
Running : on setSpeed(speed) / reference_speed = speed

@enduml
